t</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px min-w-4 flex-1 bg-line"></span></h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-3 print:mt-2 print:space-y-2.5"><div class="quill-body max-w-[62ch]"><div class="markdown"><p>Senior frontend engineer with <strong>11</strong> years of experience building design systems and data-heavy web applications. Led the <strong>2024</strong> rewrite of a customer analytics platform, cutting median page load from <strong>4.2s</strong> to <strong>1.1s</strong> and lifting weekly active usage by <strong>18%</strong>. Cares about typography, performance budgets, and interfaces that respect their readers.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="mt-9 first:mt-0 print:mt-6 print:first:mt-0" id="section-work" aria-labelledby="section-work-title"><h2 id="section-work-title" class="quill-section-title flex items-center gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><span>Work Experience</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px min-w-4 flex-1 bg-line"></span></h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-6 border-l border-line pl-5 print:mt-3 print:space-y-4 print:pl-4"><article><div class="mb-3 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 print:mb-2 print:break-after-avoid"><span class="text-[0.9rem] font-semibold text-ink">Nordlys Analytics</span><span class="quill-meta shrink-0"><time dateTime="2019-08-01T00:00:00.000Z">Aug 2019 – Present</time> • 2 roles</span></div><div class="space-y-5 print:space-y-3.5"><div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-1.5 print:mb-1 print:break-after-avoid"><time dateTime="2021-04-12" class="quill-meta">Apr 2021 – Present</time><time class="quill-meta opacity-80">(2 years, 8 months)</time></div><article class=""><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 print:gap-0.5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><h3 class="quill-entry-title min-w-0 flex-1">Staff Frontend Engineer</h3><div class="shrink-0 print:hidden"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-accent/40 bg-accent/10 px-2 py-0.5 align-middle text-[0.75rem] leading-none text-accent"><span aria-hidden="true" class="font-semibold">↑</span>3 promotions<span class="flex items-center gap-0.5" aria-hidden="true"><span class="h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-accent"></span><span class="h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-accent"></span><span class="h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-accent"></span><span class="h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-accent"></span><span class="h-1 w-1 rounded-full border border-accent/40"></span></span></span></div></div><div class="quill-context flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-ink-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M128,24a80,80,0,0,0-80,80c0,72,80,128,80,128s80-56,80-128A80,80,0,0,0,128,24Zm0,112a32,32,0,1,1,32-32A32,32,0,0,1,128,136Z" opacity="0.2"></path><path d="M128,64a40,40,0,1,0,40,40A40,40,0,0,0,128,64Zm0,64a24,24,0,1,1,24-24A24,24,0,0,1,128,128Zm0-112a88.1,88.1,0,0,0-88,88c0,31.4,14.51,64.68,42,96.25a254.19,254.19,0,0,0,41.45,38.3,8,8,0,0,0,9.18,0A254.19,254.19,0,0,0,174,200.25c27.45-31.57,42-64.85,42-96.25A88.1,88.1,0,0,0,128,16Zm0,206c-16.53-13-72-60.75-72-118a72,72,0,0,1,144,0C200,161.23,144.53,209,128,222Z"></path></svg>Copenhagen, Denmark</div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 print:gap-1 mt-1.5 print:mt-1"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-line bg-surface px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.78rem] leading-tight text-ink-3 print:px-1.5 print:py-0 print:text-[0.68rem]">TypeScript</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-line bg-surface px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.78rem] leading-tight text-ink-3 print:px-1.5 print:py-0 print:text-[0.68rem]">React</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-line bg-surface px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.78rem] leading-tight text-ink-3 print:px-1.5 print:py-0 print:text-[0.68rem]">Design systems</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-line bg-surface px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.78rem] leading-tight text-ink-3 print:px-1.5 print:py-0 print:text-[0.68rem]">Performance</span></div><div class="quill-body mt-2 print:mt-1.5"><div class="markdown"><p>Own the frontend architecture of a customer analytics platform serving <strong>40k</strong> weekly users across <strong>12</strong> markets.</p></div></div><ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 pl-4 print:mt-1.5 print:space-y-1 print:pl-3"><li class="quill-body list-disc marker:text-accent/70 print:break-inside-avoid"><div class="markdown"><p>Led a <strong>6</strong>-person team through a full rewrite of the dashboard, cutting median page load from <strong>4.2s</strong> to <strong>1.1s</strong></p></div></li><li class="quill-body list-disc marker:text-accent/70 print:break-inside-avoid"><div class="markdown"><p>Introduced a performance budget gate in CI that blocked <strong>14</strong> regressions before release</p></div></li><li class="quill-body list-disc marker:text-accent/70 print:break-inside-avoid"><div class="markdown"><p>Grew weekly active usage by <strong>18%</strong> through onboarding and empty-state redesign</p></div></li><li class="quill-body list-disc marker:text-accent/70 print:break-inside-avoid"><div class="markdown"><p>Ran the frontend guild across <strong>3</strong> product teams; established the RFC process still in use</p></div></li></ul></div></article></div><div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-1.5 print:mb-1 print:break-after-avoid"><time dateTime="2019-08-01" class="quill-meta">Aug 2019 – Apr 2021</time><time class="quill-meta opacity-80">(1 year, 8 months)</time></div><article class=""><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 print:gap-0.5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><h3 class="quill-entry-title min-w-0 flex-1">Senior Frontend Engineer</h3></div><div class="quill-context flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-ink-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M128,24a80,80,0,0,0-80,80c0,72,80,128,80,128s80-56,80-128A80,80,0,0,0,128,24Zm0,112a32,32,0,1,1,32-32A32,32,0,0,1,128,136Z" opacity="0.2"></path><path d="M128,64a40,40,0,1,0,40,40A40,40,0,0,0,128,64Zm0,64a24,24,0,1,1,24-24A24,24,0,0,1,128,128Zm0-112a88.1,88.1,0,0,0-88,88c0,31.4,14.51,64.68,42,96.25a254.19,254.19,0,0,0,41.45,38.3,8,8,0,0,0,9.18,0A254.19,254.19,0,0,0,174,200.25c27.45-31.57,42-64.85,42-96.25A88.1,88.1,0,0,0,128,16Zm0,206c-16.53-13-72-60.75-72-118a72,72,0,0,1,144,0C200,161.23,144.53,209,128,222Z"></path></svg>Copenhagen, Denmark</div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 print:gap-1 mt-1.5 print:mt-1"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-line bg-surface px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.78rem] leading-tight text-ink-3 print:px-1.5 print:py-0 print:text-[0.68rem]">React</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-line bg-surface px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.78rem] leading-tight text-ink-3 print:px-1.5 print:py-0 print:text-[0.68rem]">Component libraries</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-line bg-surface px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.78rem] leading-tight text-ink-3 print:px-1.5 print:py-0 print:text-[0.68rem]">Testing</span></div><ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 pl-4 print:mt-1.5 print:space-y-1 print:pl-3"><li class="quill-body list-disc marker:text-accent/70 print:break-inside-avoid"><div class="markdown"><p>Built the component library used by <strong>5</strong> product teams (<strong>62</strong> components, <strong>91%</strong> test coverage)</p></div></li><li class="quill-body list-disc marker:text-accent/70 print:break-inside-avoid"><div class="markdown"><p>Reduced bundle size by <strong>38%</strong> via route-level code splitting</p></div></li></ul></div></article></div></div></article><article><div class="mb-3 flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3 print:mb-2 print:break-after-avoid"><span class="text-[0.9rem] font-semibold text-ink">Brightpath</span><span class="quill-meta shrink-0"><time dateTime="2016-05-01T00:00:00.000Z">May 2016 – Jul 2019</time> • 2 roles</span></div><div class="space-y-5 print:space-y-3.5"><div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-1.5 print:mb-1 print:break-after-avoid"><time dateTime="2017-02-01" class="quill-meta">Feb 2017 – Jul 2019</time><time class="quill-meta opacity-80">(2 years, 5 months)</time></div><article class=""><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 print:gap-0.5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><h3 class="quill-entry-title min-w-0 flex-1">Frontend Engineer</h3></div><div class="quill-context flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-ink-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M128,24a80,80,0,0,0-80,80c0,72,80,128,80,128s80-56,80-128A80,80,0,0,0,128,24Zm0,112a32,32,0,1,1,32-32A32,32,0,0,1,128,136Z" opacity="0.2"></path><path d="M128,64a40,40,0,1,0,40,40A40,40,0,0,0,128,64Zm0,64a24,24,0,1,1,24-24A24,24,0,0,1,128,128Zm0-112a88.1,88.1,0,0,0-88,88c0,31.4,14.51,64.68,42,96.25a254.19,254.19,0,0,0,41.45,38.3,8,8,0,0,0,9.18,0A254.19,254.19,0,0,0,174,200.25c27.45-31.57,42-64.85,42-96.25A88.1,88.1,0,0,0,128,16Zm0,206c-16.53-13-72-60.75-72-118a72,72,0,0,1,144,0C200,161.23,144.53,209,128,222Z"></path></svg>Aarhus, Denmark</div><div class="quill-body mt-2 print:mt-1.5"><div class="markdown"><p>Frontend for a <strong>B2B</strong> logistics platform; first frontend hire on the platform team.</p></div></div><ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 pl-4 print:mt-1.5 print:space-y-1 print:pl-3"><li class="quill-body list-disc marker:text-accent/70 print:break-inside-avoid"><div class="markdown"><p>Shipped the company&#x27;s first public web store, reaching DKK <strong>12M</strong> in first-year revenue</p></div></li><li class="quill-body list-disc marker:text-accent/70 print:break-inside-avoid"><div class="markdown"><p>Took checkout conversion from <strong>2.1%</strong> to <strong>3.4%</strong> over two quarters of A/B work</p></div></li></ul></div></article></div><div><div class="flex items-baseline gap-2 mb-1.5 print:mb-1 print:break-after-avoid"><time dateTime="2016-05-01" class="quill-meta">May 2016 – Jan 2017</time><time class="quill-meta opacity-80">(8 months)</time></div><article class=""><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 print:gap-0.5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><h3 class="quill-entry-title min-w-0 flex-1">Junior Web Developer</h3></div><ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 pl-4 print:mt-1.5 print:space-y-1 print:pl-3"><li class="quill-body list-disc marker:text-accent/70 print:break-inside-avoid"><div class="markdown"><p>Fixed <strong>200</strong>+ tickets while learning the codebase; took over the CSS system</p></div></li></ul></div></article></div></div></article></div></section><section class="mt-9 first:mt-0 print:mt-6 print:first:mt-0" id="section-education" aria-labelledby="section-education-title"><h2 id="section-education-title" class="quill-section-title flex items-center gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><span>Education</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px min-w-4 flex-1 bg-line"></span></h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-6 border-l border-line pl-5 print:mt-3 print:space-y-4 print:pl-4"><article><div class="mb-2 flex items-baseline gap-2 print:mb-1.5 print:break-after-avoid"><time dateTime="2013-08-20" class="quill-meta font-medium text-ink-3">Aug 2013 – Jun 2015</time><time class="quill-meta opacity-80">(1 year, 10 months)</time></div><article class=""><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 print:gap-0.5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><h3 class="quill-entry-title min-w-0 flex-1">Computer Science<span class="font-normal text-ink-3"> at Aarhus University</span></h3></div><div class="quill-context flex items-center gap-1.5">MSc</div><div class="quill-body mt-2 print:mt-1.5"><div class="markdown"><p>GPA: <strong>12.4</strong></p></div></div></div></article></article><article><div class="mb-2 flex items-baseline gap-2 print:mb-1.5 print:break-after-avoid"><time dateTime="2010-08-20" class="quill-meta font-medium text-ink-3">Aug 2010 – Jun 2013</time><time class="quill-meta opacity-80">(2 years, 10 months)</time></div><article class=""><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 print:gap-0.5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><h3 class="quill-entry-title min-w-0 flex-1">Interactive Media<span class="font-normal text-ink-3"> at Aarhus University</span></h3></div><div class="quill-context flex items-center gap-1.5">BSc</div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 print:gap-1 mt-1.5 print:mt-1"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-line bg-surface px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.78rem] leading-tight text-ink-3 print:px-1.5 print:py-0 print:text-[0.68rem]">Human-Computer Interaction</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-line bg-surface px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.78rem] leading-tight text-ink-3 print:px-1.5 print:py-0 print:text-[0.68rem]">JavaScript</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-line bg-surface px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.78rem] leading-tight text-ink-3 print:px-1.5 print:py-0 print:text-[0.68rem]">Information Architecture</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-line bg-surface px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.78rem] leading-tight text-ink-3 print:px-1.5 print:py-0 print:text-[0.68rem]">Typography and Visual Design</span></div></div></article></article></div></section><section class="mt-9 first:mt-0 print:mt-6 print:first:mt-0" id="section-projects" aria-labelledby="section-projects-title"><h2 id="section-projects-title" class="quill-section-title flex items-center gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><span>Projects</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px min-w-4 flex-1 bg-line"></span></h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-6 border-l border-line pl-5 print:mt-3 print:space-y-4 print:pl-4"><article><article class=""><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 print:gap-0.5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><h3 class="quill-entry-title min-w-0 flex-1">gridsheet<span class="font-normal text-ink-3"> Author</span></h3></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 print:gap-1 mt-1.5 print:mt-1"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-line bg-surface px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.78rem] leading-tight text-ink-3 print:px-1.5 print:py-0 print:text-[0.68rem]">CSS</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-line bg-surface px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.78rem] leading-tight text-ink-3 print:px-1.5 print:py-0 print:text-[0.68rem]">CLI</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-line bg-surface px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.78rem] leading-tight text-ink-3 print:px-1.5 print:py-0 print:text-[0.68rem]">DX</span></div><div class="quill-body mt-2 print:mt-1.5"><div class="markdown"><p>A CSS grid layout generator that exports production-ready, minimal CSS.</p></div></div><ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 pl-4 print:mt-1.5 print:space-y-1 print:pl-3"><li class="quill-body list-disc marker:text-accent/70 print:break-inside-avoid"><div class="markdown"><p><strong>2.1k</strong> GitHub stars; used in production by <strong>3</strong> design teams</p></div></li></ul><a href="https://github.com/jkowalska/gridsheet" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[0.85rem] no-underline print:hidden">View Project<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M184,80V208a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H48a8,8,0,0,1-8-8V80a8,8,0,0,1,8-8H176A8,8,0,0,1,184,80Z" opacity="0.2"></path><path d="M224,104a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V59.32l-66.33,66.34a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.68,48H152a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h64a8,8,0,0,1,8,8Zm-40,24a8,8,0,0,0-8,8v72H48V80h72a8,8,0,0,0,0-16H48A16,16,0,0,0,32,80V208a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H176a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V136A8,8,0,0,0,184,128Z"></path></svg></a></div></article></article><article><div class="mb-2 flex items-baseline gap-2 print:mb-1.5 print:break-after-avoid"><time dateTime="2022-01-10" class="quill-meta font-medium text-ink-3">Jan 2022 – Present</time><time class="quill-meta opacity-80">(1 year, 11 months)</time></div><article class=""><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 print:gap-0.5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><h3 class="quill-entry-title min-w-0 flex-1">Nordlys Docs<span class="font-normal text-ink-3"> Docs lead</span></h3></div><div class="quill-body mt-2 print:mt-1.5"><div class="markdown"><p>Documentation site for the internal component library, serving <strong>1.4k</strong> developers.</p></div></div><ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 pl-4 print:mt-1.5 print:space-y-1 print:pl-3"><li class="quill-body list-disc marker:text-accent/70 print:break-inside-avoid"><div class="markdown"><p>Cut onboarding time for new frontend hires from <strong>3</strong> weeks to <strong>1</strong></p></div></li></ul><a href="https://docs.nordlys.example.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[0.85rem] no-underline print:hidden">View Project<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M184,80V208a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H48a8,8,0,0,1-8-8V80a8,8,0,0,1,8-8H176A8,8,0,0,1,184,80Z" opacity="0.2"></path><path d="M224,104a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V59.32l-66.33,66.34a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.68,48H152a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h64a8,8,0,0,1,8,8Zm-40,24a8,8,0,0,0-8,8v72H48V80h72a8,8,0,0,0,0-16H48A16,16,0,0,0,32,80V208a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H176a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V136A8,8,0,0,0,184,128Z"></path></svg></a></div></article></article><article><article class=""><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 print:gap-0.5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><h3 class="quill-entry-title min-w-0 flex-1">type-scale<span class="font-normal text-ink-3"> at open source</span></h3></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 print:gap-1 mt-1.5 print:mt-1"><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-line bg-surface px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.78rem] leading-tight text-ink-3 print:px-1.5 print:py-0 print:text-[0.68rem]">Typography</span><span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-line bg-surface px-2 py-0.5 text-[0.78rem] leading-tight text-ink-3 print:px-1.5 print:py-0 print:text-[0.68rem]">CSS</span></div><div class="quill-body mt-2 print:mt-1.5"><div class="markdown"><p>Generates harmonic typographic scales from a base size and ratio.</p></div></div><a href="https://github.com/jkowalska/type-scale" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[0.85rem] no-underline print:hidden">View Project<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M184,80V208a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H48a8,8,0,0,1-8-8V80a8,8,0,0,1,8-8H176A8,8,0,0,1,184,80Z" opacity="0.2"></path><path d="M224,104a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V59.32l-66.33,66.34a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L196.68,48H152a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h64a8,8,0,0,1,8,8Zm-40,24a8,8,0,0,0-8,8v72H48V80h72a8,8,0,0,0,0-16H48A16,16,0,0,0,32,80V208a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H176a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V136A8,8,0,0,0,184,128Z"></path></svg></a></div></article></article></div></section><section class="mt-9 first:mt-0 print:mt-6 print:first:mt-0" id="section-volunteer" aria-labelledby="section-volunteer-title"><h2 id="section-volunteer-title" class="quill-section-title flex items-center gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><span>Volunteer</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px min-w-4 flex-1 bg-line"></span></h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-6 border-l border-line pl-5 print:mt-3 print:space-y-4 print:pl-4"><article><div class="mb-2 flex items-baseline gap-2 print:mb-1.5 print:break-after-avoid"><time dateTime="2020-01-15" class="quill-meta font-medium text-ink-3">Jan 2020 – Present</time><time class="quill-meta opacity-80">(3 years, 11 months)</time></div><article class=""><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 print:gap-0.5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><h3 class="quill-entry-title min-w-0 flex-1">Mentor<span class="font-normal text-ink-3"> at <a href="https://opensource.dk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Source Denmark</a></span></h3></div><div class="quill-context flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-ink-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M128,24a80,80,0,0,0-80,80c0,72,80,128,80,128s80-56,80-128A80,80,0,0,0,128,24Zm0,112a32,32,0,1,1,32-32A32,32,0,0,1,128,136Z" opacity="0.2"></path><path d="M128,64a40,40,0,1,0,40,40A40,40,0,0,0,128,64Zm0,64a24,24,0,1,1,24-24A24,24,0,0,1,128,128Zm0-112a88.1,88.1,0,0,0-88,88c0,31.4,14.51,64.68,42,96.25a254.19,254.19,0,0,0,41.45,38.3,8,8,0,0,0,9.18,0A254.19,254.19,0,0,0,174,200.25c27.45-31.57,42-64.85,42-96.25A88.1,88.1,0,0,0,128,16Zm0,206c-16.53-13-72-60.75-72-118a72,72,0,0,1,144,0C200,161.23,144.53,209,128,222Z"></path></svg>Remote</div><div class="quill-body mt-2 print:mt-1.5"><div class="markdown"><p>Mentoring first-time open source contributors, from first PR to first release.</p></div></div><ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 pl-4 print:mt-1.5 print:space-y-1 print:pl-3"><li class="quill-body list-disc marker:text-accent/70 print:break-inside-avoid"><div class="markdown"><p>Mentored <strong>9</strong> first-time open source contributors to their merged PRs</p></div></li><li class="quill-body list-disc marker:text-accent/70 print:break-inside-avoid"><div class="markdown"><p>Organized the annual Copenhagen contributor day (<strong>40</strong> attendees)</p></div></li></ul></div></article></article><article><div class="mb-2 flex items-baseline gap-2 print:mb-1.5 print:break-after-avoid"><time dateTime="2015-09-01" class="quill-meta font-medium text-ink-3">Sep 2015 – Apr 2016</time><time class="quill-meta opacity-80">(7 months)</time></div><article class=""><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 print:gap-0.5"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><h3 class="quill-entry-title min-w-0 flex-1">Website Volunteer<span class="font-normal text-ink-3"> at Copenhagen Free Software Meetup</span></h3></div><ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 pl-4 print:mt-1.5 print:space-y-1 print:pl-3"><li class="quill-body list-disc marker:text-accent/70 print:break-inside-avoid"><div class="markdown"><p>Rebuilt the meetup site; doubled mobile traffic</p></div></li></ul></div></article></article></div></section></div><div class="min-w-0"><section class="mt-9 first:mt-0 print:mt-6 print:first:mt-0" id="section-skills" aria-labelledby="section-skills-title"><h2 id="section-skills-title" class="quill-section-title flex items-center gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><span>Skills</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px min-w-4 flex-1 bg-line"></span></h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-3 print:mt-2 print:space-y-2.5"><div><h3 class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 text-[0.9rem] font-semibold text-ink"><span class="min-w-0">Languages</span><span class="quill-meta shrink-0 font-normal">Expert</span></h3><p class="quill-context mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">TypeScript, JavaScript, CSS, HTML, Python</p></div><div><h3 class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 text-[0.9rem] font-semibold text-ink"><span class="min-w-0">Frameworks</span><span class="quill-meta shrink-0 font-normal">Advanced</span></h3><p class="quill-context mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">React, Next.js, Vite, Node.js, Playwright</p></div><div><h3 class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 text-[0.9rem] font-semibold text-ink"><span class="min-w-0">Practices</span><span class="quill-meta shrink-0 font-normal">Advanced</span></h3><p class="quill-context mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">Design systems, Accessibility, Performance, i18n</p></div><div><h3 class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 text-[0.9rem] font-semibold text-ink"><span class="min-w-0">Tooling</span></h3><p class="quill-context mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">Vitest, Storybook, GitHub Actions, Figma</p></div></div></section><section class="mt-9 first:mt-0 print:mt-6 print:first:mt-0" id="section-languages" aria-labelledby="section-languages-title"><h2 id="section-languages-title" class="quill-section-title flex items-center gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><span>Languages</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px min-w-4 flex-1 bg-line"></span></h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-3 print:mt-2 print:space-y-2.5"><div><h3 class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 text-[0.9rem] font-semibold text-ink"><span class="min-w-0">Danish</span><span class="quill-meta shrink-0 font-normal">Native</span></h3></div><div><h3 class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 text-[0.9rem] font-semibold text-ink"><span class="min-w-0">English</span><span class="quill-meta shrink-0 font-normal">Fluent</span></h3></div><div><h3 class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 text-[0.9rem] font-semibold text-ink"><span class="min-w-0">German</span><span class="quill-meta shrink-0 font-normal">Conversational</span></h3></div></div></section><section class="mt-9 first:mt-0 print:mt-6 print:first:mt-0" id="section-conferences" aria-labelledby="section-conferences-title"><h2 id="section-conferences-title" class="quill-section-title flex items-center gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><span>Conferences</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px min-w-4 flex-1 bg-line"></span></h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-3 print:mt-2 print:space-y-2.5"><article class="break-inside-avoid"><div class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><h3 class="text-[0.9rem] font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Calmer Dashboards: Density and Rest in Data UIs</h3><div class="quill-context mt-0.5">Copenhagen Frontend Conference</div><div class="quill-meta mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-x-2.5 gap-y-0.5"><time dateTime="2024-05-16">2024</time><a href="https://cphfrontend.example.com/talks/quiet-interfaces" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View Talk</a></div><div class="quill-body mt-1.5 text-[0.9rem]"><div class="markdown"><p>The conference version of the Quiet Interface essay: what 40k weekly users tolerate, and why less is more.</p></div></div></div></div></article><article class="break-inside-avoid"><div class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><h3 class="text-[0.9rem] font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Typography Scales That Hold Up</h3><div class="quill-context mt-0.5">Typographica</div><div class="quill-meta mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-x-2.5 gap-y-0.5"><time dateTime="2023-09-08">2023</time><a href="https://typographica.example.com/talks/scales" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View Talk</a></div><div class="quill-body mt-1.5 text-[0.9rem]"><span class="text-ink-3">J. Kowalska-Nielsen</span></div></div></div></article></div></section><section class="mt-9 first:mt-0 print:mt-6 print:first:mt-0" id="section-publications" aria-labelledby="section-publications-title"><h2 id="section-publications-title" class="quill-section-title flex items-center gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><span>Publications</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px min-w-4 flex-1 bg-line"></span></h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-3 print:mt-2 print:space-y-2.5"><article class="break-inside-avoid"><div class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><h3 class="text-[0.9rem] font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">The Quiet Interface: Density and Rest in Data UIs</h3><div class="quill-context mt-0.5">Frontend Focus</div><div class="quill-meta mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-x-2.5 gap-y-0.5"><time dateTime="2024-02-20">2024</time></div><div class="quill-body mt-1.5 text-[0.9rem]"><div class="markdown"><p>On designing dashboards that show more by shouting less.</p></div></div></div></div></article><article class="break-inside-avoid"><div class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><h3 class="text-[0.9rem] font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">CSS Grid, Finally</