 href="https://cssdesignawards.example.com/sotd/nordlys" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View Award</a></div></div></div></article></div></section><section class="mt-9 first:mt-0 print:mt-6 print:first:mt-0" id="section-references" aria-labelledby="section-references-title"><h2 id="section-references-title" class="quill-section-title flex items-center gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><span>References</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px min-w-4 flex-1 bg-line"></span></h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-3 print:mt-2 print:space-y-2.5"><article class="break-inside-avoid"><div class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><h3 class="text-[0.9rem] font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Mette Andersen</h3><div class="quill-context mt-0.5">CTO, Nordlys Analytics</div><div class="quill-body mt-1.5 text-[0.9rem]"><div class="markdown"><p>Johanna is the engineer I call when &#x27;elegant&#x27; and &#x27;shipped&#x27; have to be the same sentence.</p></div></div></div></div></article><article class="break-inside-avoid"><div class="flex items-start gap-2.5"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><h3 class="text-[0.9rem] font-semibold leading-snug text-ink">Lars Sørensen</h3><div class="quill-context mt-0.5">Design Director, Brightpath</div><div class="quill-body mt-1.5 text-[0.9rem]"><div class="markdown"><p>Available on request.</p></div></div></div></div></article></div></section><section class="mt-9 first:mt-0 print:mt-6 print:first:mt-0" id="section-interests" aria-labelledby="section-interests-title"><h2 id="section-interests-title" class="quill-section-title flex items-center gap-3 print:break-after-avoid"><span>Interests</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px min-w-4 flex-1 bg-line"></span></h2><div class="mt-3 space-y-3 print:mt-2 print:space-y-2.5"><div><h3 class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 text-[0.9rem] font-semibold text-ink"><span class="min-w-0">Typography</span></h3><p class="quill-context mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">Serif revivals, Variable fonts</p></div><div><h3 class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 text-[0.9rem] font-semibold text-ink"><span class="min-w-0">Cycling</span></h3><p class="quill-context mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">Long distance</p></div><div><h3 class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2 text-[0.9rem] font-semibold text-ink"><span class="min-w-0">Coffee</span></h3><p class="quill-context mt-0.5 leading-relaxed">Pour over, Konnict-style cupping</p></div></div></section></div></div></div></div></body>
